Audio Duration: 3m 8.7s (188.73s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 09:45:15 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 13 | Text: 一个人成功的开始一定是先学会不要脸
Segment #2   [00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,700] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 你赚不到钱的本质
Segment #3   [00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,920] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 就是你的修实性和道德感太强了
Segment #4   [00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,540] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 你见识的人多了你会发现
Segment #5   [00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,440] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 越他妈越穷的人他越在乎脸面
Segment #6   [00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,940] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 就越生活在社会地层的人越老实
Segment #7   [00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,900] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 11 | Text: 你看这类人他最大的特点是什么
Segment #8   [00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:14,860] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是不争不强
Segment #9   [00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:15,760] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 自事清高
Segment #10  [00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,560] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 15 | Text: 奉行了什么所谓吃亏是福的这种理念
Segment #11  [00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,700] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 11 | Text: 但是到最后往往是因为这类人
Segment #12  [00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,960] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 最容易被社会所淘汰
Segment #13  [00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,920] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 13 | Text: 而且我可以给你们讲一个非常现实的观点
Segment #14  [00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:27,440] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 13 | Text: 就是学习好的人他并不一定能混得好
Segment #15  [00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,460] | Elapsed:  15.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 但一个不要脸的人他一定吃得开
Segment #16  [00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,040] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果说你接下来
Segment #17  [00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,520] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 你也比较年轻
Segment #18  [00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,700] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 13 | Text: 刚才说会或者你感觉到自己不要老实
Segment #19  [00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:36,880] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 7  | Text: 你一定要学会这个技能
Segment #20  [00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,820] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是他很有可能会改变你的一生
Segment #21  [00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:39,840] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 那就是不要脸
Segment #22  [00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,740] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 9  | Text: 你千万不要觉得这是在骂人
Segment #23  [00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,520] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 10 | Text: 其实我给你们所有人都是一样的
Segment #24  [00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,240] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 4  | Text: 你要放在以前
Segment #25  [00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,440] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果别人要说我不要脸
Segment #26  [00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:47,260] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 说我脸比后
Segment #27  [00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,420] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 12 | Text: 我会瞬间站在这小脸都痛苦
Segment #28  [00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,920] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 13 | Text: 我以为我都感觉这是别人在骂我
Segment #29  [00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,760] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 5  | Text: 我会觉得羞愧
Segment #30  [00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,440] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 我会觉得特别的丢脸
Segment #31  [00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:55,640] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是你要放在现在行
Segment #32  [00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,120] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 8  | Text: 现在人家要说我不要脸
Segment #33  [00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,360] | Elapsed:  33.50s | Words: 6  | Text: 我会觉得很开心
Segment #34  [00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,800] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为不管是在感情中
Segment #35  [00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,100] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 还是在生活社交中
Segment #36  [00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,140] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 你会发现当你学会不要脸的时候
Segment #37  [00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,140] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 你会过得非常的爽
Segment #38  [00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,100] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 因为你不太快
Segment #39  [00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,600] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 需要考虑任何人的感受
Segment #40  [00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,000] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 什么所谓的道德
Segment #41  [00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:08,640] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 2  | Text: 素页
Segment #42  [00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,580] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 那都是空的
Segment #43  [00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:10,460] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 3  | Text: 是假的
Segment #44  [00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:11,360] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就一句一句
Segment #45  [00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,140] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 评价是说给死人听的
Segment #46  [00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:14,380] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 只有自己过得舒服
Segment #47  [00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:15,700] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 钱装在他妈装自己
Segment #48  [00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,540] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 都是你这才是真的
Segment #49  [00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:18,040] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 其他的全部都是扯淡
Segment #50  [00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,300] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 别人想要成功
Segment #51  [00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,120] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 想要去赚到钱
Segment #52  [00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,800] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 一定是要先学会丢脸
Segment #53  [00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,860] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就像我一样
Segment #54  [00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,400] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 其实我身边很多朋友
Segment #55  [00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,720] | Elapsed:  51.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们也想做秘密体
Segment #56  [00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,760] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 11 | Text: 当然又怕被身边的书人刷到
Segment #57  [00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,040] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 怕别人嘲讽
Segment #58  [00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:32,800] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后怕身边人评价的假
Segment #59  [00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:33,960] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 你的小子你不物正义
Segment #60  [00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:34,820] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 你天天配短上评
Segment #61  [00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:35,700] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 这玩意儿能行吗
Segment #62  [00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:36,580] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 其实我告诉你
Segment #63  [00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:37,620] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 这种心态很正常
Segment #64  [00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,160] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一开始我也是这样的
Segment #65  [00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:41,340] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是一旦你能够在这个事情上
Segment #66  [00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:42,300] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 得到正反馈
Segment #67  [00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,420] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 能赚到钱的时候
Segment #68  [00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:44,940] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 你会发现什么脸面
Segment #69  [00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:45,680] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 什么尊严
Segment #70  [00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,200] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 他都是服务
Segment #71  [00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,660] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 没有选上的那么重要
Segment #72  [00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,140] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 4  | Text: 能赚到钱
Segment #73  [00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:51,560] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 这才是最重要的
Segment #74  [00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,160] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 3  | Text: 你想象一下
Segment #75  [00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:54,120] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说一个人能够靠丢脸
Segment #76  [00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:54,800] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 就能赚到钱
Segment #77  [00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,340] | Elapsed:  70.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 那你觉得这个世界上
Segment #78  [00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:57,820] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 9  | Text: 还有比这个还简单的事情吗
Segment #79  [00:01:57,820 --> 00:01:58,920] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 所以说有些时候
Segment #80  [00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:01,700] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 11 | Text: 你要把空一几的长山脱下来
Segment #81  [00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:03,000] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 10 | Text: 你会发现你能过得更好
Segment #82  [00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,820] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 12 | Text: 我可以给你举一个很现实的例子
Segment #83  [00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:05,980] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你现在去刷一些
Segment #84  [00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:07,580] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 那些招聘软件
Segment #85  [00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:09,040] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 你关键词就说什么
Segment #86  [00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:09,760] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 诸家保姆
Segment #87  [00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:10,660] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 上面扫地的
Segment #88  [00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:12,140] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 你别看不起这份工作
Segment #89  [00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:13,340] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 你去看看人工资
Segment #90  [00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:15,780] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 10 | Text: 至少都七八千以上起步的
Segment #91  [00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:17,840] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 11 | Text: 你要像在广州上海这种城市
Segment #92  [00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,840] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 9  | Text: 那工资可能得一个W起步
Segment #93  [00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,560] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 80%的人他可能
Segment #94  [00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,080] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 12 | Text: 一个月挣的钱还不如人家一半
Segment #95  [00:02:23,580 --> 00:02:25,140] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是大部分人还瞧瞧
Segment #96  [00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:25,960] | Elapsed:  89.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 瞧不上人家
Segment #97  [00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,680] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 为什么呢
Segment #98  [00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,400] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为我们从小到大所接受的教育
Segment #99  [00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,240] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是在告诉你
Segment #100 [00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,160] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 你要有一份体面的工作
Segment #101 [00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,540] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 你拉不下来面子
Segment #102 [00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:33,280] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 你没有尊严
Segment #103 [00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,020] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 你怕丢脸
Segment #104 [00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:36,180] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是这个社会是非常现实的
Segment #105 [00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:37,060] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要想赚到钱
Segment #106 [00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:38,420] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 实现阶级的乐声
Segment #107 [00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:39,840] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就要做一个脸皮厚
Segment #108 [00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,240] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 甚至不要脸的人
Segment #109 [00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,720] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 在我看来脸面这个东西
Segment #110 [00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:43,760] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 它是最不值钱的
Segment #111 [00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:44,220] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 相反
Segment #112 [00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:45,720] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果仅仅是靠丢脸
Segment #113 [00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:47,420] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 就能赚到我想要的财富
Segment #114 [00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:48,640] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 那我是乐于自己的
Segment #115 [00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,320] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以说
Segment #116 [00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:50,720] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 我想给你们表达的意思就是
Segment #117 [00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:51,900] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 3  | Text: 在现在开始
Segment #118 [00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,940] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 学会后脸皮
Segment #119 [00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:54,540] | Elapsed: 108.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 去争取你们想要的东西
Segment #120 [00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:55,160] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 去拒绝
Segment #121 [00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:55,880] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 你不想做的
Segment #122 [00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:58,100] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 11 | Text: 不要过度去在意别人的评价
Segment #123 [00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:59,540] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就一个人的成功
Segment #124 [00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,540] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 一定是先学会
Segment #125 [00:03:00,540 --> 00:03:01,520] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 不要脸开始的
Segment #126 [00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,740] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 所有人的评价和看法都是暂时的
Segment #127 [00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:04,800] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是一个人兜里的钱
Segment #128 [00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,800] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 能伴随他一辈子
Segment #129 [00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,260] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 老天呐
Segment #130 [00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:06,780] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 干就完了
Segment #131 [00:03:06,780 --> 00:03:07,280] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 2  | Text: 不干
Segment #132 [00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:07,860] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 2  | Text: 全完了
Segment #133 [00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:08,240] | Elapsed: 121.21s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
